'''February Gauntlet''' (2月強襲！, ''2 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''February Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during February and was added in the [[Version 11.1 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Ritual Happiness (Monthly Event)|Ritual Happiness]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The February Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Happiness Lvs''' (召喚 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Happiness Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[February Gauntlet/Happiness Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*February Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Ritual Happiness (Monthly Event)|Ritual Happiness]].

